e ensemble compte pour UNE arrivee, pas une par oiseau. Le comptage sert de proxy aux EVENEMENTS de transport, et le modele predit du transport : quatre hirondelles venues du meme systeme sont un evenement, pas quatre, et les compter separement pondererait cet evenement quatre fois. L'argument ne vaut pas pour les parulines et les vireos, qui arrivent en individus independants. min 8 -> 7 : les 2 Cliff Swallow comptent pour une arrivee. Le jour reste largement positif","source_primary":"Corvo Birders daily log + regle du groupe 2026-10-18","evidence_tier":"A_direct_daily_log","audit_flag":"flock_rule_applied","species_named":7,"species_list_partial":false},{"date":"2021-10-09","new_landbirds_min":1,"new_landbirds_best":1.0,"status":"exact_min","effort_score":0.95,"zero_reliable":0,"species_new":"Cape May Warbler","species_present":null,"notes":"Cape May Warbler explicitly found 9th; other listed birds may include 8th arrivals/stayers.","source_primary":"master+ordinal","evidence_tier":"A_direct_daily_log","audit_flag":null,"species_named":1,"species_list_partial":false},{"date":"2021-10-10","new_landbirds_min":0,"new_landbirds_best":0.0,"status":"exact_zero","effort_score":0.95,"zero_reliable":1,"species_new":null,"species_present":null,"notes":"Daily log has no Nearctic landbird; waterbirds only.","source_primary":"master+ordinal","evidence_tier":"A_direct_daily_log","audit_flag":null,"species_named":null,"species_list_partial":false},{"date":"2021-10-11","new_landbirds_min":2,"new_landbirds_best":2.0,"status":"lower_bound","effort_score":0.95,"zero_reliable":0,"species_new":"Swainson's Thrush; Indigo Bunting","species_present":null,"notes":"Both appear newly in daily log; conservative lower bound.","source_primary":"master+ordinal","evidence_tier":"A_direct_daily_log","audit_flag":null,"species_named":2,"species_list_partial":false},{"date":"2021-10-12","new_landbirds_min":1,"new_landbirds_best":1.0,"status":"exact","effort_score":0.95,"zero_reliable":0,"species_n